        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "location": {
              "line": 3,
              "heading": "Instrument Cluster Warning Alerts"
            },
            "text": "The instrument cluster in Aventro Motors vehicles is designed to inform the driver about the status of various vehicle systems. Each symbol or indicator light provides information on system performance, potential malfunctions, or urgent warnings requiring immediate action."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "location": {
              "line": 5,
              "heading": "Instrument Cluster Warning Alerts"
            },
            "text": "Below is a list of common warning alerts you may see in Aventro Motors cars, along with their meanings:"
          }
        ],
        "sections": [
          {
            "title": "1. Engine Warning Light (Check Engine)",
            "level": 2,
            "location": {
              "line": 9,
              "heading": "Instrument Cluster Warning Alerts"
            },
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "list",
                "location": {
                  "line": 10,
                  "heading": "1. Engine Warning Light (Check Engine)"
                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Meaning: Indicates a problem with the engine or emissions control system. Immediate diagnosis is recommended.",
                    "depth": 0
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "sections": []
          },
          {
            "title": "2. Battery Warning Light",
            "level": 2,
            "location": {
              "line": 12,
              "heading": "Instrument Cluster Warning Alerts"
            },
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "list",
                "location": {
                  "line": 13,
                  "heading": "2. Battery Warning Light"
                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Meaning: The battery is not charging properly. This could signal alternator failure, battery issues, or wiring problems.",
                    "depth": 0
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "sections": []
          },
          {
            "title": "3. Oil Pressure Warning Light",
            "level": 2,
            "location": {
              "line": 15,
              "heading": "Instrument Cluster Warning Alerts"
            },
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "list",
                "location": {
                  "line": 16,
                  "heading": "3. Oil Pressure Warning Light"
                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Meaning: Low oil pressure detected. Stop the engine and check oil levels to avoid engine damage.",
                    "depth": 0
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "sections": []
          },
          {
            "title": "4. Brake System Warning Light",
            "level": 2,
            "location": {
              "line": 18,
              "heading": "Instrument Cluster Warning Alerts"
            },
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "list",
                "location": {
                  "line": 19,
                  "heading": "4. Brake System Warning Light"
                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Meaning: Possible issues with the brake system such as low fluid, worn brake pads, or handbrake engaged.",
                    "depth": 0
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "sections": []
          },
          {
            "title": "5. ABS Warning Light",
            "level": 2,
            "location": {
              "line": 21,
              "heading": "Instrument Cluster Warning Alerts"
            },
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "list",
                "location": {
                  "line": 22,
                  "heading": "5. ABS Warning Light"
                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Meaning: Indicates a malfunction in the Anti-lock Braking System. Normal brakes may function, but ABS will not.",
                    "depth": 0
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "sections": []
          },
          {
            "title": "6. Airbag Warning Light",
            "level": 2,
            "location": {
              "line": 24,
              "heading": "Instrument Cluster Warning Alerts"
            },
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "list",
                "location": {
                  "line": 25,
                  "heading": "6. Airbag Warning Light"
                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Meaning: There may be a problem with the airbag system; airbags may not deploy in a collision.",
                    "depth": 0
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "sections": []
          },
          {
